WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:03.080
AI systems should be evaluated before and after deployment.

00:00:03.300 --> 00:00:10.260
Evaluation may examine accuracy, reliability, bias, privacy, security, safety, usability, and business impact.

00:00:10.480 --> 00:00:16.880
Monitoring helps detect drift, failures, misuse, unexpected behavior, and changes in performance.

00:00:17.100 --> 00:00:21.180
It also helps teams notice when assumptions made during review no longer hold.

00:00:21.400 --> 00:00:28.040
Change management matters because models, prompts, data sources, vendors, tools, and workflows can change over time.

00:00:28.260 --> 00:00:33.460
AI governance should ensure that important changes are reviewed rather than silently altering risk.

00:00:33.680 --> 00:00:37.760
Evaluation and monitoring turn governance into an ongoing practice.
